{"step_index":325,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-08-26T07:08:50Z","content":"I have updated the **\"Why Join StreamWave?\"** section on the landing page with the exact requested copy, clean red-and-white inline SVG line icons, a centered Call to Action block, subtle red top borders, and responsive multi-column layouts.\n\n---\n\n### 🎨 Summary of Changes\n\n1. **Files Modified**:\n   - **[`public/index.html`](file:///C:/Users/dell/.gemini/antigravity/brain/228fe0bc-0a77-489e-a1ba-57d617247457/public/index.html)**:\n     - Section Heading: **“Entertainment That Feels Like Home”**\n     - Section Subtitle: **“Discover Zimbabwean films, music and creative stories in one beautifully simple streaming experience.”**\n     - Card 1: **“Zimbabwean Stories, Centre Stage”** with Film Reel inline SVG icon.\n     - Card 2: **“Find Your Next Favourite”** with Magnifying Glass / Search inline SVG icon.\n     - Card 3: **“Enjoy It on Your Screen”** with Multi-Device (phone/tablet/desktop) inline SVG icon.\n     - Card 4: **“Easy Ways to Access”** with Wallet / Card inline SVG icon.\n     - Centered CTA Block: **“Ready to discover something new?”** with **“Explore the Catalogue”** button linking to `/checkout` (or `/library` when authenticated).\n     - Discreet Academic Note: *“Academic prototype: payment and subscription features are simulated, and no real financial transaction is processed.”*\n   - **[`public/css/styles.css`](file:///C:/Users/dell/.gemini/antigravity/brain/228fe0bc-0a77-489e-a1ba-57d617247457/public/css/styles.css)**:\n     - Applied `border-top: 3px solid var(--accent-red)` to each card.\n     - Added restrained card hover lift (`transform: translateY(-4px)`).\n     - Styled clean SVG icon containers (`56px x 56px` in dark graphite surface).\n     - Enforced equal card heights with vertical flex layout.\n     - Added media queries for 4 columns (desktop), 2 columns (tablets <=991px), and 1 column (mobile <=599px).\n\n---\n\n### 🚀 Push the Update to GitHub & Vercel\n\nRun these commands in your Command Prompt window to push the changes to GitHub and trigger automatic Vercel re-deployment:\n\n```cmd\ngit add .\n```\n\n```cmd\ngit commit -m \"feat: Improve benefits section with customer-focused copy, SVG line icons, and CTA block\"\n```\n\n```cmd\ngit push origin main\n```"}
